{"id":"40a15b3a28b6cc89","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/611_Chellas_条件逻辑.md","title":"611 Chellas 条件逻辑","display":"611_Chellas_条件逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cond}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cond}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{611}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{611}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{611}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{611}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{611}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{611}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{611}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{611}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{611}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{611}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{611}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,611}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,611}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{611}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{611}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{611}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{611}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{611}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{611}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Chellas 条件核心：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{611}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{611}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{611}\n=\n\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{611}\n=\n\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AND}^{611}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to((A\\Rightarrow C)\\to(A\\Rightarrow(B\\land C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AND}^{611}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to((A\\Rightarrow C)\\to(A\\Rightarrow(B\\land C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{611}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{611}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AND}^{611}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{611}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{611}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{611}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AND}^{611}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{611}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{611}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{611}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{611}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{611}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\Rightarrow C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{611}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\Rightarrow C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEC}^{611}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEC}^{611}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{611}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{611}\\)</span> 为四个规则关系的并。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{611}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{611}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{611}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{611}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow C)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow C)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{611}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{611}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{611}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{611}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{611}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{611}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{611}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{611}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{611}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{611}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{611}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{611}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{611}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{611}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{611}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{611}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{611}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{611}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{611}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{611}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{611}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\vdash_{611}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{611}(A\\Rightarrow C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCEA),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{611}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{611}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCEC).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\vdash_{611}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{611}(A\\Rightarrow C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCEA),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{611}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{611}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCEC).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-选择函数语义\">8. 选择函数语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"611\">\\(611\\)</span>-Chellas 选择函数模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CMod}_{611}\">\\(\\mathsf{CMod}_{611}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq X\">\\(\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq X\\)</span>。公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\Rightarrow B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\Rightarrow B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{611}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{611}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{611}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{611}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{CMod}_{611}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{611}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{611}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{611}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{CMod}_{611}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{611}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{611}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>Chellas 条件逻辑在 CK 上加入 ID、条件后件合取以及前件和后件的等价替换规则；这些由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{611}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{ID}^{611}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AND}^{611}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{AND}^{611}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{611}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{611}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEC}^{611}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEC}^{611}\\)</span> 明确定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>所有规则均是从有限公式元组到公式的关系，证明对象规定 RCK/RCEA/RCEC 只能使用空依赖定理作为前提。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Ch}_{611}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\operatorname{FV}_{611},\\operatorname{BV}_{611},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{611},\\operatorname{Sub}_{611},\\equiv_{\\alpha,611},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{611},\\mathsf{Rule}_{611},\\mathsf{Proof}_{611},\\operatorname{last}_{611},\n\\vdash_{611},\\mathsf{Thm}_{611},\\mathsf{Cert}_{611},\n\\mathsf{CMod}_{611},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{611},\\Vdash_{611},\\models_{611}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Ch}_{611}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\operatorname{FV}_{611},\\operatorname{BV}_{611},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{611},\\operatorname{Sub}_{611},\\equiv_{\\alpha,611},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{611},\\mathsf{Rule}_{611},\\mathsf{Proof}_{611},\\operatorname{last}_{611},\n\\vdash_{611},\\mathsf{Thm}_{611},\\mathsf{Cert}_{611},\n\\mathsf{CMod}_{611},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{611},\\Vdash_{611},\\models_{611}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含条件句法演算、选择函数语义、满足关系与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-选择函数语义","text":"8. 选择函数语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cond}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{611}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{611}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{611}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{611}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\